  "privacy.children.body": `This platform is intended for use by individuals aged 18 or above. We do not knowingly collect personal data from minors. If we become aware that a minor has created an account, we will immediately close the account and delete the related data.`,
  "privacy.children.heading": `9. Children's Privacy`,
  "privacy.complaints.body": `If you have any questions or complaints regarding how the platform handles your personal data, please contact:`,
