  "privacy.cookies.body": `We use cookies and similar technologies to maintain login sessions, remember user preferences, and collect anonymous statistics to improve our service. You may disable cookies through your browser settings, but some features (such as staying logged in) may not function properly. We currently do not use third-party advertising tracking.`,
  "privacy.cookies.heading": `7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies`,
  "privacy.crossBorder.body": `Our primary data storage facilities are located in Hong Kong. If data needs to be transferred outside Hong Kong for technical reasons (e.g., use of global cloud services), we will ensure that the recipient's level of protection is no less than that required by the Ordinance.`,
  "privacy.crossBorder.heading": `8. Cross-border Data Transfer`,
  "privacy.dpp1.body": `We only collect personal data that is directly necessary for the provision of our platform services, using lawful and fair means:`,
  "privacy.dpp1.heading": `1. Types of Data Collected · DPP1 (Purpose and Manner of Collection)`,
  "privacy.dpp1.list.account": `Account data: email, password hash, display name, avatar.`,
  "privacy.dpp1.list.contact": `Contact details: mobile phone (if provided), Google SSO email verification status.`,
  "privacy.dpp1.list.kyc": `Identity verification (KYC): copy of ID document, selfie (for high-value transactions).`,
  "privacy.dpp1.list.technical": `Technical data: IP address, browser type, device identifier, login times, activity logs.`,
  "privacy.dpp1.list.transaction": `Transaction data: listing content, messages, orders, shipping addresses, payment records, and dispute records.`,
  "privacy.dpp1.purposes": `Purposes of collection include: (i) verifying user identity; (ii) facilitating and completing transactions; (iii) dispute resolution; (iv) preventing fraud, money laundering, and illegal activity; (v) legal compliance; (vi) service improvement. Failure to provide certain required data may prevent you from using related features.`,
  "privacy.dpp2.body1": `We take reasonable steps to ensure the personal data we hold is accurate. Users can update their personal data at any time via`,
  "privacy.dpp2.body1Suffix": `.`,
  "privacy.dpp2.heading": `2. Accuracy and Retention Period · DPP2`,
  "privacy.dpp2.myAccountLink": `"My Account"`,
  "privacy.dpp2.retention.account": `Account data: until 90 days after account deletion; if there are incomplete transactions or disputes, retained until 7 years after resolution.`,
  "privacy.dpp2.retention.kyc": `KYC data: retained for at least 5 years as required by the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorist Financing Ordinance (Cap. 615).`,
  "privacy.dpp2.retention.logs": `Technical logs: typically retained for 90 days; logs related to disputes or security incidents may be retained until the investigation concludes.`,
  "privacy.dpp2.retention.transaction": `Transaction records: retained for 7 years to meet tax and business record requirements.`,
  "privacy.dpp2.retentionIntro": `Data retention periods:`,
  "privacy.dpp3.body": `We will only use personal data for the purposes notified at the time of collection, or for new purposes for which we have obtained prior explicit consent from the user. Without consent, we will only disclose personal data in the following circumstances:`,
  "privacy.dpp3.heading": `3. Use and Disclosure · DPP3`,
  "privacy.dpp3.list.1": `Disclosing to the other party to a transaction the minimum data necessary to complete it (e.g., the seller sees the buyer's shipping address, the buyer sees the seller's display name);`,
  "privacy.dpp3.list.2": `Disclosing to the authenticator the item and transaction data directly relevant to the authentication;`,
  "privacy.dpp3.list.3": `Disclosing to service providers such as payment processors and cloud storage providers the data necessary to perform their services, with a requirement that they observe equivalent confidentiality obligations;`,
  "privacy.dpp3.list.4": `Disclosure as required by law, court order, or lawful request from law enforcement authorities.`,
  "privacy.dpp3.noSale": `We do not sell your personal data to third parties for direct marketing purposes. Should we intend to do so in the future, we will first seek the user's written consent (in accordance with section 35C of the Ordinance).`,
  "privacy.dpp4.body": `We implement the following practical measures to protect personal data from unauthorised or accidental access, processing, deletion, loss, or use:`,
  "privacy.dpp4.heading": `4. Security Measures · DPP4`,
  "privacy.dpp4.list.1": `Transport layer encryption (HTTPS/TLS) covering all communication between clients and servers;`,
  "privacy.dpp4.list.2": `Passwords stored using one-way hashing (bcrypt), never retained in plaintext;`,
  "privacy.dpp4.list.3": `Role-based access control and the principle of least privilege: staff only access data as necessary for their work;`,
  "privacy.dpp4.list.4": `Regular backups and audit logs;`,
  "privacy.dpp4.list.5": `Third-party cloud service providers must hold ISO 27001 or equivalent SOC 2 certification.`,
  "privacy.dpp5.body": `This policy, the Terms of Service, and collection statements for specific features (such as authentication booking and dispute filing) are publicly available on the platform. In the event of material changes, we will update this page and, where applicable, notify users by email.`,
  "privacy.dpp5.heading": `5. Transparency · DPP5`,
  "privacy.dpp5.termsLink": `Terms of Service`,
  "privacy.dpp6.body": `Under sections 18 and 22 of the Ordinance, you have the right to:`,
  "privacy.dpp6.contact": `Please send access or correction requests in writing to`,
  "privacy.dpp6.heading": `6. Access and Correction · DPP6`,
  "privacy.dpp6.list.1": `Enquire whether we hold your personal data;`,
  "privacy.dpp6.list.2": `Obtain a copy of such data (we may charge a reasonable fee in accordance with section 28(2) of the Ordinance);`,
  "privacy.dpp6.list.3": `Request correction of inaccurate data;`,
  "privacy.dpp6.list.4": `Withdraw previously given consent to data processing (without affecting the lawfulness of processing carried out prior to withdrawal).`,
  "privacy.dpp6.responseTime": `We will respond within 40 days.`,
  "privacy.heading": `Privacy Policy`,
  "privacy.intro": `This policy explains how Certifine Ltd. ("the Platform," "we," "us") collects, uses, stores, discloses, and protects your personal data. We comply with the six Data Protection Principles (DPP1 – DPP6) set out in the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance (Cap. 486, the "Ordinance") of Hong Kong.`,
