  "terms.acceptanceBanner": `These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User") and Certifine Ltd. ("the Platform," "we," "us"). By using the platform, you accept these Terms. If you are under the age of 18 or do not accept any part of these Terms, please cease use immediately.`,
  "terms.contact.disputesLabel": `Disputes:`,
