  "terms.heading": `Terms of Service`,
  "terms.lastUpdated": `Last updated: 30 June 2026 · Version 1.0`,
  "terms.page.title": `Terms of Service · Certifine`,
  "terms.section1.body1": `The platform is an information intermediary. We provide the technical infrastructure for listings, search, messaging, escrow, and authentication booking, but we do not own, hold, or sell any goods. The transaction is a contract between buyer and seller; the authentication opinion is the professional judgment of the authenticator.`,
  "terms.section1.body2": `Any references in the platform's UI or copy to "authentication passed," "authenticity conclusion," or similar terms represent the individual opinion of the named authenticator and not a guarantee by the platform.`,
  "terms.section1.heading": `1. Nature of the Platform`,
  "terms.section10.body1": `To the fullest extent permitted by law, the platform shall not be liable for:`,
  "terms.section10.body2": `The platform shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential losses (such as loss of anticipated profits) suffered by any user.`,
  "terms.section10.heading": `10. Limitation of Liability`,
  "terms.section10.list.1": `The authenticity of goods (borne by the authenticator);`,
  "terms.section10.list.2": `Misrepresentation by the seller or delivery failure (borne by the seller);`,
  "terms.section10.list.3": `Delays caused by force majeure, including but not limited to network outages and third-party payment failures.`,
  "terms.section11.body": `These Terms may be updated from time to time. Material changes will be notified via email or in-platform notice, and the "Last updated" date on this page will be revised. Continued use of the platform after such changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.`,
  "terms.section11.heading": `11. Amendments`,
  "terms.section12.body": `These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region. Any disputes shall be submitted to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region.`,
  "terms.section12.heading": `12. Governing Law and Jurisdiction`,
  "terms.section2.heading": `2. User Eligibility`,
  "terms.section2.list.1": `Must be at least 18 years old and have the legal capacity to enter into a binding contract.`,
  "terms.section2.list.2": `Must provide true and accurate personal data; identity verification (KYC) may be required depending on the category and transaction tier.`,
  "terms.section2.list.3": `The platform reserves the right to refuse, suspend, or terminate any account for reasonable cause.`,
  "terms.section3.heading": `3. Seller Obligations`,
  "terms.section3.list.1": `Must have lawful ownership and the right to sell the listed item, and the item must be from a legitimate source.`,
  "terms.section3.list.2": `Must truthfully describe and photograph the item's condition, brand, model, accessories, defects, and grade. Violation of the Trade Descriptions Ordinance (Cap. 362) is the seller's own legal responsibility.`,
  "terms.section3.list.3": `Must not list items prohibited by law, including under the Import and Export (Strategic Commodities) Regulations and the Dangerous Drugs Ordinance.`,
  "terms.section3.list.4": `Must complete delivery (shipping or meetup) within the timeframe specified by the system after the buyer confirms the order.`,
  "terms.section4.heading": `4. Buyer Obligations`,
  "terms.section4.list.1": `Must complete payment within the timeframe specified by the system after placing an order. Orders not paid on time may be automatically cancelled.`,
  "terms.section4.list.2": `Must inspect and confirm receipt of goods within the specified timeframe after delivery. Failure to act within the timeframe will be deemed as acceptance of receipt.`,
  "terms.section4.list.3": `Must not unreasonably delay or request a refund without objective grounds.`,
  "terms.section5.body1": `Authentication services are provided by independent authenticators. Authenticators are self-employed professionals and are not employees of the platform. Each authenticator holds their own professional liability insurance (E&O Insurance) and bears independent legal responsibility for their authentication conclusions.`,
  "terms.section5.body2": `Authentication conclusions may be "Genuine," "Counterfeit," or "Inconclusive." If multiple authenticators disagree on the same item, the platform will only provide the mechanism to assist the parties in resolution and will not make a final ruling on authenticity.`,
  "terms.section5.body3": `Authenticator ratings (1–5 stars) are derived purely by algorithm based on completed order volume and dispute rate, and are not subject to manual adjustment.`,
  "terms.section5.heading": `5. Authentication Service`,
  "terms.section6.heading": `6. Fees`,
  "terms.section6.list.1": `Platform fee 1.5%: deducted from the seller's proceeds upon successful transaction.`,
  "terms.section6.list.2": `Authentication fee: set by the authenticator (percentage + minimum fee) and clearly displayed before checkout.`,
  "terms.section6.list.3": `Refund: a full refund is available before the transaction enters the authentication stage; thereafter, the refund shall be handled according to the conditions set out below.`,
  "terms.section6.list.4": `The platform reserves the right to adjust fee rates, with changes announced on this page at least 30 days in advance. Existing orders will be grandfathered.`,
  "terms.section7.body1": `The buyer's payment is collected by the platform at the time of order. The funds will be released to the seller only when all of the following conditions are met:`,
  "terms.section7.body2": `If the authentication concludes the item is counterfeit, the full payment will be refunded to the buyer. The item will be handled according to the system process or returned to the seller.`,
  "terms.section7.heading": `7. Escrow`,
  "terms.section7.list.1": `(If applicable) The authenticator has completed authentication and issued a conclusion other than counterfeit;`,
  "terms.section7.list.2": `The buyer confirms receipt, or does not raise any objection within the system's specified timeframe.`,
  "terms.section8.heading": `8. Prohibited Content and Conduct`,
  "terms.section8.list.1": `Infringing items, counterfeits (knowingly listed as genuine), smuggled goods, and regulated items;`,
  "terms.section8.list.2": `Directing transactions off the platform to circumvent platform fees or escrow;`,
  "terms.section8.list.3": `Spamming, rating manipulation, and self-dealing;`,
  "terms.section8.list.4": `Any conduct that violates the laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region.`,
  "terms.section9.body": `In the event of a dispute between buyer, seller, and/or authenticator, please first attempt to resolve it through in-platform messaging. If consensus cannot be reached, a complaint may be submitted to disputes@certifine.hk. The platform will assist in preserving conversation records, payment receipts, and authentication reports to help clarify the facts, but will not make a final ruling. If necessary, the parties may pursue civil litigation, mediation through the Consumer Council, or arbitration.`,
  "terms.section9.emailLabel": `Submit a complaint`,
  "terms.section9.heading": `9. Dispute Resolution`,
